# Getaway Glamer {W}, Spree: "+ {2} - Destroy target creature if no other creature has greater power." Bot2's Giant Cindermaw
# (4 power) outpowers Bot1's 1/1 Spirit tokens, so as the only creature that big it is destroyed: the target itself is not
# an "other creature". With three mana ({W} + {2}) the first and second modes together ({W} + {1} + {2} = four) cannot be paid
# for, but the second mode alone can. A Mox is no creature and no target.

